abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
shay kehte the duniya se yeh , mera bhai sidhara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara …<br>
<br>
1. har simth se hain teer o sina barchiya bhale<br>
abbas kaha ab jo mujhey aake sambhale<br>
toota hain falak mujh mein nahi jeene ka yara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
2. karbal main akela huwa bin tere aye bhai<br>
har gaam musibat huwa bin tere aye bhai<br>
har zakh se aanch uthti hain jalta hain yeh sehra<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
3. lakho the adoo aur akela tha wo sakha<br>
youn nehr pe khabza kiya pyassa raha sakha<br>
abbas se kab door tha dariya ka kinara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
4. poorsooz hain karbal ki fiza karti hain matam<br>
moo ashkoun se dhoti hain wafa karti hain matam<br>
nazaan thi wafa jispe wo dildaar sidhara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
5. maghmoom si dhankan hai to zakhmi si fikar hai<br>
tooti hai kahin aas kahin chak jigar hain<br>
abbas sa ghazzi o wafa daar sidhara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
6. har saans mein ab zikr tera karti hain zainab<br>
ab apne hi bazzo ko takka karti hain zainab<br>
duniya mein nahi koi bhi ab uska sahara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
7. be chain bohat rehti hain ab bali sakina<br>
pani bhi nahi mangti ab bali sakina<br>
veeraan si ankhoun mein hain bas aks tumhara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
8. kehti hain sakina yahi ba didaye purnam<br>
pani na pohunchne ka hain ammu ko bohot gham<br>
kya aysa koi karta hain duniya se kinara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
9. aajayengi wo dhundti maidan mein bibi<br>
margayegi ghut ghut ke wo zindan mein bibi<br>
ajaye usey sabr tumhe khoke khudara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
10. hai hai huwa be dast yeh bhai mera abbas<br>
bin hatoun ke anna wo zameen par tera abbas<br>
ek karb ka dariya hain nahi jiska sahara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
11. bhaiya tumhare saat gaya sabke dil ka chain<br>
tanha hain ab hujoom mein zehra ka nooreain<br>
abaad kiya tumne to dariya ka kinara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
12. bazoo yeh katte tere zameen se to uthaloun<br>
tehro zara abbas gale se to lagaloun<br>
kadmoun mein hai ab nehr bhi aur uska kinara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
13. ayi hain pasand tumko yeh dariya ki tarayi<br>
khayesh hain yahi shair ka maskan ho tarayi<br>
laasha bhi utha sakta nahi bhai tumhara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara<br>
<br>
14. sarwat yahi aati thi sada zehra ki ran se<br>
zinda na phirega mera ghazi kabhi ran se<br>
abbas e ali tha mere bachoun ka sahara<br>
abbas abbas-e-alamdar sidhara
